# Intermediate showcase output. The campaign record and the published frame are tracked, because
# the README shows the frame and the frame is only meaningful if the run behind it is readable.
# The plate renders and full-resolution masters they are built from are not: they are large, and
# `render_plate.py` reproduces them from the record.
examples/discovering-colors/renders/*
!examples/discovering-colors/renders/discovering-colors.png
